        "systemVersion": "5.3.0",
        "createdTime": null,
        "modifiedTime": null,
        "lastModifiedBy": null
      },
      "text": {
        "content": "<h1>Ailen Moraven</h1><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"modules/blooming-rot-2/assets/portraits/ailen-moraven-portrait.png\" alt=\"Portrait of Ailen Moraven\" style=\"max-width: 420px; border-radius: 4px;\"></p><p>Tamsin Moraven's daughter, nineteen, has been living quietly in Hardby since her mother's disappearance. Watchful, traveled, cautious. The party may meet her early in Phase 3 and use her safe-house if they earn her trust.</p>",
        "format": 1,
        "markdown": null
      }
    },
    {
      "_id": "BR2P3PoPgAnverTarsh",
      "_key": "!journal.pages!BR2P3PortraitJr.BR2P3PoPgAnverTarsh",
      "name": "Anver \"Tarsh\" Resh",
      "type": "text",
      "title": {
