        "systemVersion": "5.3.0",
        "createdTime": null,
        "modifiedTime": null,
        "lastModifiedBy": null
      },
      "text": {
        "content": "<h1>Anver \"Tarsh\" Resh</h1><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"modules/blooming-rot-2/assets/portraits/anver-resh-portrait.png\" alt=\"Portrait of Anver \"Tarsh\" Resh\" style=\"max-width: 420px; border-radius: 4px;\"></p><p>The intermediary who hired Merev Sarth. Former Cindren &amp; Vhal Hardby clerk under Solen Mereth (576–582 CY), now a freelance broker operating out of the Coopered Wreck tavern. The Phase 3 confrontation node — yields names if cornered with leverage, will not testify, will not name his Rel Astra contact.</p>",
        "format": 1,
        "markdown": null
      }
    },
    {
