      "text": {
        "content": "<h1>Castrian Vell</h1><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"modules/blooming-rot-2/assets/portraits/castrian-vell-portrait.png\" alt=\"Portrait of Castrian Vell\" style=\"max-width: 420px; border-radius: 4px;\"></p><p>Trina Alvere's Hardby contact, social host for the Commercial Cover party. Mid-forties, dark curls graying at the temples, careful smile that learned, over years, to look like welcome whether or not it actually is.</p>",
        "format": 1,
        "markdown": null
      }
    },
