      "text": {
        "content": "<h1>Dren Marsh</h1><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"modules/blooming-rot-2/assets/portraits/dren-marsh-portrait.png\" alt=\"Portrait of Dren Marsh\" style=\"max-width: 420px; border-radius: 4px;\"></p><p>Former harbor-watch corporal, now sleeping guard at the C&amp;V Hardby branch. Stat block: MM Warrior Veteran (per journal attribution). Half-asleep when first encountered; sharper than he looks.</p>",
        "format": 1,
        "markdown": null
      }
    },
