        "content": "<h1>Edrin Saetar</h1><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"modules/blooming-rot-2/assets/portraits/edrin-saetar-portrait.png\" alt=\"Portrait of Edrin Saetar\" style=\"max-width: 420px; border-radius: 4px;\"></p><p>Sculptor master in the Salters' Quarter. Tutoring Ailen Moraven free of charge — a small kindness in honor of Tamsin's father, who he served under decades ago.</p>",
        "format": 1,
        "markdown": null
      }
