      "text": {
        "content": "<h1>Hesren Vesh</h1><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"modules/blooming-rot-2/assets/portraits/hesren-vesh-portrait.png\" alt=\"Portrait of Hesren Vesh\" style=\"max-width: 420px; border-radius: 4px;\"></p><p>Junior C&amp;V Hardby clerk who was recalled to Hardby from a Loftwick assignment shortly after the firm became aware of the Yeomanry inquiry. Honest, anxious, and over his head; the party can extract him if they reach him in time.</p>",
        "format": 1,
        "markdown": null
