        "content": "<h1>Joren Krill</h1><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"modules/blooming-rot-2/assets/portraits/joren-krill-portrait.png\" alt=\"Portrait of Joren Krill\" style=\"max-width: 420px; border-radius: 4px;\"></p><p>Hardby weighmaster, on Cindren &amp; Vhal's payroll. Named in Tamsin Moraven's unsent letters as the man who signed off on weights that did not exist. Knows enough to be dangerous; trades information for safe passage.</p>",
        "format": 1,
        "markdown": null
