      "text": {
        "content": "<h1>Mira Cindren</h1><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"modules/blooming-rot-2/assets/portraits/mira-cindren-portrait.png\" alt=\"Portrait of Mira Cindren\" style=\"max-width: 420px; border-radius: 4px;\"></p><p>Veshen Cindren's cousin and the C&amp;V Hardby junior partner who handles official delegations. Polite, prepared, gives nothing useful. The face the party meets if they show up under the Official Delegation banner.</p>",
        "format": 1,
        "markdown": null
      }
