      "text": {
        "content": "<h1>Olfard</h1><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"modules/blooming-rot-2/assets/portraits/olfard-portrait.png\" alt=\"Portrait of Olfard\" style=\"max-width: 420px; border-radius: 4px;\"></p><p>Barkeep at the Coopered Wreck on the Hardby waterfront. Sixty, broken nose from a long-ago brawl, pretends not to listen and remembers everything. Will not fight; will sell what he knows for the right reason.</p>",
        "format": 1,
        "markdown": null
      }
