        "content": "<h1>Solen Mereth</h1><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"modules/blooming-rot-2/assets/portraits/solen-mereth-portrait.png\" alt=\"Portrait of Solen Mereth\" style=\"max-width: 420px; border-radius: 4px;\"></p><p>The compromised senior clerk of the Hardby branch. Late sixties, not corrupt by inclination but pressured into compliance for nearly three years. Yields under proper procedural pressure; will not survive the trial that follows.</p>",
        "format": 1,
        "markdown": null
      }
