      "text": {
        "content": "<h1>Tamsin Moraven</h1><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"modules/blooming-rot-2/assets/portraits/tamsin-moraven-portrait.png\" alt=\"Portrait of Tamsin Moraven\" style=\"max-width: 420px; border-radius: 4px;\"></p><p>The rescued captive whose disappearance triggers Phase 2 and 3. Forty, runs (ran) a counting house on Tannerway. Mother of Ailen, wife of Vellin. Recovered alive but altered by the experience.</p>",
        "format": 1,
        "markdown": null
      }
    },
